            "end_line": 45,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// Non-positive years are BCE; positive years are CE. AccountingEra expectedEra = (prolepticYear <= 0) ? AccountingEra.BCE : AccountingEra.CE; assertEquals(expectedEra, dateByProlepticYear.getEra());"
